    "title": "Правила: Whereas vs While – Grammar Shorts",
    "level": "SHORTS",
    "overview": "Whereas и while оба могут сравнивать две ситуации, но while имеет дополнительные meanings.",
    "main_rule": "Whereas mainly contrasts facts/characteristics. While can contrast, express time, or sometimes concession.",
    "form": "whereas + clause. while + clause.",
    "when_why": "Если нужен только contrast between facts → whereas. Если while — determine from context whether it means time or contrast.",
    "examples": "The first option is cheap, whereas the second is faster. → Первый вариант дешёвый, тогда как второй быстрее.\nThe first option is cheap, while the second is faster. → Первый вариант дешёвый, тогда как второй быстрее.\nWhile I was working, she called. → Пока я работал, она позвонила.\nWhile I understand your point, I disagree. → Хотя я понимаю твою точку зрения, я не согласен.",
    "special_cases": "Whereas is more formal and especially common in writing. While can mean during the time that or contrast/concession.",
    "common_mistakes": "❌ Assume every while = whereas. → Нет: while can be time.\n✅ While I was working... = time, not contrast.",
    "dont_confuse": "whereas = contrast.\nwhile = contrast OR time OR concession.",
    "quick_summary": "whereas → contrastive.\nwhile → contrast/time/concession."
  },
